----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Release 5.3
----------------------------
- add: ThumbnailGenerator extension
- improve: extend verification process to also include libraries (see README)
- improve: reworked python script for generating verifications
- improve: better handling of install prefix, including configure options for subfolder
- improve: localize also entries in manifest
- change: bump target API level to 2, requires PhotoQt 5.3 or later


Release 5.2 - 2026-02-20
----------------------------
- CropImage: harden how info between QML and CPP is passed
- ExportImage: don't attemp exporting with no format selected to avoid crash
- ExportImage: harden how info between QML and CPP is passed
- ScaleImage: fix setting font properties for buttons


Release 5.1 - 2026-01-16
----------------------------
- add: cmake options to disable individual extensions during build
- improve: install instructions
- fix: building with GraphicsMagick


Release 5.0 - 2025-12-23
----------------------------
- first release of extensions, extracted from code previously integrated in PhotoQt
